      "body": "As was said the the bug report https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/56559, this is not a vllm's bug when there is no xgrammar dependency installed because xgrammar is a hard dependency in vllm. For more details, see Flora's [comment](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/56559#issuecomment-5863311405) in the bug report.\r\nSo, because of that I think we can close this PR. Thank you for your work!",
